d":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-14T20:58:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T17:58:22Z","closed_at":"2025-06-09T17:54:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106409","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106409.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106409.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-09T17:54:32Z"},"body":"* Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#1631.\r\n* Supersedes #82987.\r\n* Continuation of #67777.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nabstract class Item:\r\n    abstract func get_name() -> String\r\n\r\n    func use() -> void:\r\n        print(\"Character used %s.\" % get_name())\r\n\r\nclass HealingPotion extends Item:\r\n    func get_name() -> String:\r\n        return \"Healing Potion\"\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    var potion := HealingPotion.new()\r\n    potion.use() # Prints `Character used Healing Potion.`\r\n```\r\n\r\n* An abstract function cannot have a body. An abstract function declaration ends with a newline or a semicolon.\r\n* A class that has at least one unimplemented abstract method (own or inherited) must be declared abstract.\r\n* An abstract method of a base class cannot be called with `super()`.\r\n* An abstract method implemented in a child class can be marked as abstract again in a grandchild class.\r\n* Static functions cannot be abstract because GDScript does not yet have late static binding.\r\n* Inline setters/getters cannot be abstract (but separate functions can).\r\n* Constructors can be abstract (but GDScript does not check signature compatibility for constructors).\r\n* Lambda functions cannot be abstract because there is no point in doing so.\r\n* The warning `UNUSED_PARAMETER` is not produced for abstract functions.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106409/reactions","total_count":88,"+1":37,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":27,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":2,"eyes":15},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106409/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}